      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we publish `Name` and `Type` via `xyz.openbmc_project.Configuration.Exposes`, is it possible to drop them from the other `xyz.openbmc_project.Configuration.${Type}` interfaces ?\n\nSince with your patch there would be a dedicated interface to get those properties, consumers would not require duplicating them across multiple interfaces.",
