      "writtenOn": "2026-10-21T16:02:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Would that work for you, or do you have something else in mind?\n\nWhat if you created the required patches to migrate consumers as part of this topic and then the whole topic could be merged at once, avoiding the increase in D-Bus traffic or other resource tradeoffs due to this change.\n\nThat approach also removes the risk of a migration stuck at the half-way point due to potentially unresponsive maintainers or maintainers of EM consumers who do not agree with your migration changes to their code.\n\nAnother idea would be to make the migration a per-type migration but that comes with additional complexity and has the same issues with half-way point stalled migration progress.",
      "parentUuid": "e947bedf_a052631d",
      "revId": "441ada7b20ec5a2a0870c70c1354ff7803ec6031",
