      "message": "That makes sense to me. Since the migration touches dbus-sensors, pldm and spdm, I\u0027d like to get support from those maintainers before starting on it, so I\u0027ve raised it in the Discord thread on PLDM/SPDM device naming: https://discord.com/channels/775381525260664832/1534765185460338769",
